WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.432
- By the way, congratulations.

00:00:01.432 --> 00:00:02.265
- Thank you!

00:00:02.265 --> 00:00:05.314
(clapping and cheering)

00:00:05.314 --> 00:00:07.720
Can you... I can't believe it.

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:09.020
I mean, even from the very first...

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:10.466
it's been seventeen years first of all.

00:00:10.466 --> 00:00:11.299
- What?

00:00:11.299 --> 00:00:12.900
- That is crazy.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:13.750
- What is that? Are we old?

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:14.781
You can have it.

00:00:14.781 --> 00:00:15.614
- Thank you.

00:00:15.614 --> 00:00:16.447
- I haven't drank out of it.

00:00:16.447 --> 00:00:17.280
It's Essentia Water if you like it.

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:18.524
- You might want to get a rabies shot.

00:00:18.524 --> 00:00:19.790
- It's been seventeen years, y'all,

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:22.170
I would have never thought that show

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:24.058
would have had the impact.

00:00:24.058 --> 00:00:25.570
I mean look at what it did,

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:27.670
the domino effect was crazy.

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:29.980
- I actually genuinely do not believe

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:31.650
we would be sitting here today

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:33.540
if you hadn't entered the show that year.

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:36.197
(audience cheering and clapping)

00:00:36.197 --> 00:00:37.030
- Not true.

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:41.216
- But, I mean, the whole
premise of the show was

00:00:41.216 --> 00:00:45.118
we had to find a star who
was gonna sell records.

00:00:45.118 --> 00:00:47.219
We found some great
people that whole year,

00:00:47.219 --> 00:00:52.219
but when you delivered that
moment on that first live show,

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:55.460
and when you sang that
winning song at the end--

00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:56.293
- It was a game changer.

00:00:56.293 --> 00:00:58.420
- We looked at each other
at the end, at the finale,

00:00:58.420 --> 00:01:00.810
and said, "wow," this
thing is really gonna work.

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:02.762
I think that was the moment that we knew.

00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:04.330
- Wasn't it crazy, cause I remember

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:06.520
Nikki and Justin and I, we had no idea.

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:07.550
We ended up being the top three,

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:09.720
and we had no idea the show
had blown up like it had,

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:10.830
because we were all in that bubble.

00:01:10.830 --> 00:01:12.520
At Kodak Theater, I think
that's when it hit all of us.

00:01:12.520 --> 00:01:13.640
We were like, wait, what?

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:14.731
People know my name?

00:01:14.731 --> 00:01:15.704
- We were sitting in the balcony.

00:01:15.704 --> 00:01:16.854
- [Kelly] Y'all were in the balcony.

00:01:16.854 --> 00:01:17.687
- Simon put us in the balcony--

00:01:17.687 --> 00:01:18.570
- Oh, no, no, no. So yes,

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:20.930
so we turned up at that
night, at the final.

00:01:20.930 --> 00:01:22.510
And we were looking forward
to it, thinking, you know,

00:01:22.510 --> 00:01:24.050
we've worked hard to get to this point.

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:25.350
We turn up at the Dolby Theater,

00:01:25.350 --> 00:01:26.770
where I saw you a couple of weeks ago.

00:01:26.770 --> 00:01:27.603
- Yeah.

00:01:27.603 --> 00:01:30.720
- And we were taken to
the very, very, very top

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:31.553
of the theater.

00:01:31.553 --> 00:01:32.386
- The nose bleeds.

00:01:32.386 --> 00:01:34.330
- And I was like, "How can
we judge the show from here?"

00:01:34.330 --> 00:01:35.601
And they went, "You're not judging it."

00:01:35.601 --> 00:01:37.519
And we went, "Well, what
are we supposed to be doing?

00:01:37.519 --> 00:01:38.641
Just watch?"

00:01:38.641 --> 00:01:40.750
- They told Justin and I
we were doing that duet

00:01:40.750 --> 00:01:42.764
that we did live, on
live national television

00:01:42.764 --> 00:01:44.896
like three minutes before live national

00:01:44.896 --> 00:01:46.180
television started.
- What?

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:47.013
You didn't even know?

00:01:47.013 --> 00:01:48.380
- No, literally we were
both standing there

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:49.213
we were like, "What"?

00:01:49.213 --> 00:01:50.990
- Do you guys remember where we saw her?

00:01:50.990 --> 00:01:53.015
It was like a VFW, like a veteran's hall.

00:01:53.015 --> 00:01:53.848
- [Paula] Yes.

00:01:53.848 --> 00:01:56.633
- Like really, we really--
- That was the craziest day

00:01:56.633 --> 00:01:57.466
of your life.
- I remember

00:01:57.466 --> 00:01:58.299
what you were wearing, Kelly.

00:01:58.299 --> 00:01:59.620
- We literally started from
the bottom and now we're here.

00:01:59.620 --> 00:02:00.567
- I freaked out, cause I was like,

00:02:00.567 --> 00:02:02.225
"Who is the English guy"?

00:02:02.225 --> 00:02:04.900
Like, when I walked in, I'll
tell you, I knew nothing.

00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:07.030
I literally had just moved back from L.A.

00:02:07.030 --> 00:02:07.970
My place had burned down,

00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:09.950
I was living in my car
for three days here.

00:02:09.950 --> 00:02:11.320
And then finally, I was
like I gotta go home.

00:02:11.320 --> 00:02:12.516
And somebody told me about the audition,

00:02:12.516 --> 00:02:14.670
and I literally walked in,

00:02:14.670 --> 00:02:15.720
I had no idea what I was doing

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:16.660
I didn't know it was a T.V. show

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:18.300
until the audition I
was in front of y'all.

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:21.030
I was like, Paula Abdul
is here, some Simon dude.

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:21.863
- Yes, um--

00:02:21.863 --> 00:02:22.744
- [Kelly] He's just some English dude.

00:02:22.744 --> 00:02:26.303
(audience cheering)

00:02:26.303 --> 00:02:27.760
- I also did recognize Randy

00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:30.040
because I knew he had played with Mariah

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:32.220
and I was like, "Oh,
snap, what's happening?"

00:02:32.220 --> 00:02:33.530
- Didn't you reverse roles or something?

00:02:33.530 --> 00:02:34.363
- I did.

00:02:34.363 --> 00:02:35.435
- You were sitting behind the curtain.

00:02:35.435 --> 00:02:36.301
- I got a little nervous

00:02:36.301 --> 00:02:38.700
because y'all asked me
to sing another song.

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:39.887
'Cause I sang "At Last" and you said,

00:02:39.887 --> 00:02:40.720
"sing another song."

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:41.610
And I literally sat there going

00:02:41.610 --> 00:02:43.810
sing any song but "itchie, gitchie ya-ya"

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:44.822
cause everyone was singing that

00:02:44.822 --> 00:02:46.230
♪ "Itchie, gitchie ya-ya" ♪

00:02:46.230 --> 00:02:47.739
Everyone was doing "Lady
Marmalade" and I was like,

00:02:47.739 --> 00:02:50.427
any song but that, and
then out of nowhere,

00:02:50.427 --> 00:02:51.760
"Express Yourself" came out.

00:02:51.760 --> 00:02:52.740
I don't know why.

00:02:52.740 --> 00:02:55.240
- That was like of the most exciting days,

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:56.468
but I have another--

00:02:56.468 --> 00:02:59.850
- Well, and on that day
when she auditioned,

00:02:59.850 --> 00:03:00.830
I knew you were gonna win.

00:03:00.830 --> 00:03:01.730
- Oh really, well I happened to--

00:03:01.730 --> 00:03:02.563
- No you didn't.

00:03:02.563 --> 00:03:03.396
- I did.

00:03:03.396 --> 00:03:04.229
I never watch these shows.

00:03:04.229 --> 00:03:05.980
But I saw some woman named Callie,

00:03:05.980 --> 00:03:08.780
an older woman on America's Got Talent

00:03:08.780 --> 00:03:10.936
that was unbelievable the other day.

00:03:10.936 --> 00:03:12.870
She's like 60 years old, or something.

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:14.712
She's ridiculously good, Simon.

00:03:14.712 --> 00:03:15.545
- Who?

00:03:15.545 --> 00:03:16.900
- And you stood up, who?

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:18.815
You stood up and gave
her a standing ovation.

00:03:18.815 --> 00:03:21.269
- That was Paula at the VMAs.

00:03:21.269 --> 00:03:23.519
(laughter)

00:03:25.801 --> 00:03:26.659
- Paula?

00:03:26.659 --> 00:03:28.109
- You got the shows mixed up.

